abstract: >-
  An evidence-backed shared mathematical document backend with independent
  Chinese, Japanese, and Korean locale profiles. It standardizes formula,
  provenance, build, extraction, and render mechanics without constructing a
  merged CJK language or allowing one language to authorize another.
